<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LILLESTROM, Norway 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from group B of</p>
<p>the women's European soccer Championship semifinal match on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Italy	 2	Spain	1 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Italy - Silvia Fiorini 11, Carolina Morace 29</p>
<p>Spain - Maria Angeles Parajo Jimenez 86</p>
<p>Yellow card:</p>
<p>Spain - Yolanda Mateos</p>
